Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.29,0:09:24.42,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\fn@汉仪旗黑 95S\frz270\an7\fs76\3c&HF7EB62&\blur5\bord2\fad(350,0)\pos(101,502)}最后一球 开球
